  - [Payment Intents API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/sunbit/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=elements&api-integration=paymentintents)
- [Direct API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/sunbit/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=direct-api)
- Mobile:
  - [iOS](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/sunbit/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=ios)
  - [Android](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/sunbit/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=android)
